## Command

```shell
biome lint .
biome lint --only=noAstroInvalidGetStaticPathsReference --only=noAstroUnserializableClientProps --only=noAstroRedirectInComponents --only=noAstroClientDirectiveOnAstroComponent --only=noAstroComponentInFramework --only=noAstroDuplicatePageInitialization --only=noAstroUnappliedStyleVars .
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "html": { "experimentalFullSupportEnabled": true },
  "linter": { "rules": { "preset": "none" } }
}
```

## `Button.svelte`

```svelte
<script>import { Picture } from "astro:assets";</script><Picture />
```

## `Component.astro`

```astro
---
import Card from "./Card.astro";
import Button from "./Button.svelte";
const posts = ["first"];
const click = () => {};
export function getStaticPaths() { return posts; }
if (!Astro.locals.user) return Astro.redirect("/login");
---
<Card client:visible />
<Button client:load onClick={click} />
<script>
function initialize() {}
document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", initialize);
document.addEventListener("astro:page-load", initialize);
</script>

```

